    q_error_gen --> [*]: rollback or report error
    q_success --> [*]: test data ready

    note right of q_insert_teams
        INV-001: team names must be unique
        INV-002: discord_role_id must be a valid Discord snowflake ID
        INV-003: generation must be a positive integer
